WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:49.630
<b>Retainers of Glory</b>

3
00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:52.840
<b>Rear

Entrance</b>

4
00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.200
[SHISHILIAN]
Sir Kin'emon! Sir Denjiro!

5
00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.080
Godspeed ahead!

6
00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.870
And to you as well!

7
00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:23.750
[all laugh]

8
00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.130
We're out of money! What now?

9
00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:27.220
Oops!

10
00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:30.080
[DOGSTORM]
Oh no! What about dinner?

11
00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:32.460
Yes! Here's the plan!

12
00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.460
Let's head to town and beg!

13
00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:35.500
Please, no.

14
00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:46.780
It must've been hard. I'm sorry.

15
00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.080
[IZO]
Kin.

16
00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:55.040
Don't stop. We must go on.

17
00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:56.590
Izo?

18
00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:06.350
This may be our end.
Are you certain?

19
00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:09.660
I've missed too many chances
for a meaningful death.

20
00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:17.480
All right. Onward.

21
00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:18.940
Okiku.

22
00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:45.030
[Oden yells]

23
00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:52.210
[KAIDO]
So. I have given you
a choice, samurai of Orochi.

24
00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.580
[KAIDO]
You're free to
die alongside your lord,

25
00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:58.000
if you like.

26
00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.630
But wouldn't you rather
conquer the world with me?

27
00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.970
[KAIDO]
I know that you
samurai are famously loyal.

28
00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:08.640
[KAIDO]
And if any of you have
the courage to challenge us,

29
00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.890
you have my respect.

30
00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.690
I speak for all our ninjas.

31
00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:19.940
As head of the Oniwabanshu,
I pledge my forces to you.

32
00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:22.530
We are 5,000 strong!

33
00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.950
The samurai, who also
number 5,000 in total,

34
00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.540
pledge their allegiance as well!

35
00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.330
[KAIDO]
I welcome you!

36
00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:38.920
[Beast Pirates cheer]

37
00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:43.120
Our lord is dead.
Well, whatever.

38
00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:46.040
[Beast Pirate A laughs]
That's great, man!

39
00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.790
I'm so glad we're not enemies!

40
00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:49.670
I didn't wanna have to kill you!

41
00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:51.210
Here's to a bright
future! [laughs]

42
00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.360
How dare you call
yourself samurai after that?

43
00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.070
Not now, Boss. We gotta lay low!

44
00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:06.010
[laughs]
Well, what do you know!

45
00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:10.350
That idiot's flunkies couldn't
wait to get a new master!

46
00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:11.940
Nice thinking, Kaido!

47
00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:15.190
[laughs]

48
00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:22.250
[Big Mom cackles]

49
00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:26.720
[BIG MOM]
Our forces are already
coming together nicely!

50
00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:29.750
Let me go!

51
00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.580
[CARROT]
Hey! Ow! Don't be a jerk!

52
00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:35.170
Keep those slippery
Straw Hats restrained.

53
00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:39.380
- [Carrot screams]
- [cackles]

54
00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:42.300
[NAMI]
If you think you've won,
you're dead wrong.

55
00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:46.390
As long as Shinobu escapes,
we still have a chance!

56
00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:49.220
[SHINOBU]
Forgive me, Onami!
I'm going ahead!

57
00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:53.140
[NAMI]
I'll be fine. Just save Momo!

58
00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:56.150
[SHINOBU]
Lord Oden knew from the start!

59
00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:59.280
Taking down Orochi
doesn't change anything!

60
00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:02.700
For 20 years, Kaido has
been our true enemy.

61
00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:05.070
The only target that matters!

62
00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:11.960
[Beast Pirates cheering]

63
00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:12.840
[laughs]

64
00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.140
There's no shogun in Wano now.

65
00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:21.890
All his samurai, all his ninja,
all his men, will serve me.

66
00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.520
[KAIDO]
The people in the Flower Capital

67
00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.480
don't know a damn thing.

68
00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.520
They're dancing the night away,

69
00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.940
in what'll be their
final hours of freedom.

70
00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:38.940
[chuckles]

71
00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:43.400
'Cause I'll say one thing. I've
always had my doubts about you.

72
00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.360
It's hard for me to believe

73
00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:48.740
that you're the son of
a man like Kozuki Oden.

74
00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:51.540
You're nothing but
a whimpering coward.

75
00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:54.920
That's not true.

76
00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:57.830
[gasps]

77
00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:01.460
This execution serves
to bring an end

78
00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:04.260
to the Land of Wano
as you know it.

79
00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:07.640
I've been thinking back
to the day 20 years ago,

80
00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:10.260
when we met
in the burning castle.

81
00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:15.640
I asked a question
you never answered.

82
00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:24.900
[MOMONOSUKE]
Someone. Help.

83
00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:29.050
Now tell me your name, damn it!

84
00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.300
Spineless brat!

85
00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.880
[whimpering]

86
00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.270
Somebody, help!

87
00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.780
[Momonosuke screaming]

88
00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.160
[KAIDO]
If you're not the son
of Kozuki Oden and Toki,

89
00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:53.370
then I'll cancel your
execution immediately

90
00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.290
and let you walk free.

91
00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.910
[KAIDO]
You would have my apologies.

92
00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:02.340
It would have been
a great mistake on my part.

93
00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:09.550
[KAIDO]
But if it wasn't an
error, and you are their son,

94
00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:12.050
you'll suffer
the same fate as Oden.

95
00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:14.930
And die by my hand.

96
00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:20.940
[panting]

97
00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.560
[gasps]

98
00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:25.290
[KAIDO]
Now, brat. One last time.

99
00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.560
What is your name?

100
00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:31.030
[BEAST PIRATE A]
See how
generous the commander can be?

101
00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:32.070
[BEAST PIRATE B]
Don't worry, kid,

102
00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:33.700
your dad won't be
ashamed of you!

103
00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:34.470
He's been dead for years!

104
00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:38.470
Come up with a funny name
for us, okay? You got this!

105
00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:36.780
[Beast Pirates cackle]

106
00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:42.810
[Beast Pirates C laugh]

107
00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.580
[HYOGORO]
No one will look down on you

108
00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.000
if you have to lie,
Lord Momonosuke.

109
00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.420
Just please, stay alive!

110
00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.390
[YAMATO]
What? Are you serious?

111
00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:03.770
That boy is the real
Kozuki Momonosuke?

112
00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:07.350
'Course he is!
Oden's retainers are alive, too!

113
00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:11.040
Huh? What?!

114
00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.610
[Beast Pirates groan]

115
00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.590
The enemy!

116
00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.910
[Luffy grunts]

117
00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.120
[LUFFY, KIN'EMON]
Get out of my way!

118
00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.040
[gasps]

119
00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.460
You mean the samurai made it?

120
00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:32.340
All of them are alive? Really?

121
00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.720
So Oden's sacrifice
was worth it!

122
00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.930
That's great!
He did it! [giggles]

123
00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:43.100
Why are we standing around?

124
00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:46.230
Let's get out there
and rescue Momonosuke!

125
00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.270
I can't wait!

126
00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.650
If the Akazaya Nine are here,

127
00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.610
then that means
I get to meet them!

128
00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.480
[LUFFY]
Put me down, Yomato!

129
00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:57.110
Huh? Wait a sec.
What did you just call me?

130
00:09:57.110 --> 00:10:00.240
[BEAST PIRATE F]
Master Yamato! Please stop!

131
00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.580
Come back!

132
00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.450
Master Yamato
and Straw Hat Luffy

133
00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.580
are heading to the floor
and moving fast!

134
00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.160
You mean the Performance Floor?

135
00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:09.370
[BEAST PIRATE G]
Yes, sir!

136
00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:11.130
We're closing in to
catch them right now!

137
00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.880
No, don't bother.
You're no match for...

138
00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.800
[Beast Pirate G groans]

139
00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.550
Beating up my men now, are you?

140
00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:24.160
[ULTI]
Yamato! I'm gonna bust you up!

141
00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:28.830
[Juki snoring]

142
00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:33.110
[screams]
Usopp! Stop!
We can't go this way!

143
00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.280
It's too scary! Too scary!

144
00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.570
This whole mission is scary,
but you heard them!

145
00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.200
They're gonna kill Momo!

146
00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.070
I know, but look!

147
00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.950
Those giants!
They'll gobble us up!

148
00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:48.580
They'll grind our bones
to make their bread!

149
00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.250
We can do this, pal!

150
00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:53.500
Even an Emperor of the Sea
couldn't take us out, right?

151
00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:57.590
If Big Mom can't beat
General Franky, then no one can!

152
00:10:57.890 --> 00:10:59.350
I can't!

153
00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:01.550
I don't care!
They're still too scary!

154
00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:05.390
Don't freak out!
You're scaring me, too!

155
00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:08.270
Tank Commander Chopper,
what's your order?

156
00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.310
[Usopp, Chopper scream]

157
00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.570
[LUFFY]
What is your deal?

158
00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:26.320
You're a samurai, huh? So what?

159
00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:27.140
'Cause I'm gonna be
King of the Pirates!

160
00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:27.530
I'm

161
00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:31.950
Your father's
a great man, Momonosuke.

162
00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:34.330
Your father's a great man.

163
00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:37.730
Momonosuke, one day,
you will rule this land.

164
00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:39.460
Then you'll understand.

165
00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:40.710
[gasps]

166
00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.600
[ODEN]
Hm? You want to know
the meaning of your name?

167
00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.970
Yes!

168
00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.430
I want you to be strong.

169
00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:57.940
But more than that,
you should be

170
00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.650
compassionate and broad-minded.

171
00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:04.740
[Momonosuke grunting]

172
00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:07.200
Momo!

173
00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.160
The word "Momo" means
peerless among men!

174
00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:12.120
"Momo" is a word that means
peerless among men!

175
00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.160
[gasps]

176
00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:14.950
You want my name?

177
00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:18.160
It's Kozuki Momonosuke!

178
00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:20.240
Hear me now!

179
00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:22.040
I shall become

180
00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:28.290
the Shogun of the Land of Wano!

181
00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:30.300
[Both giggle]

182
00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.810
Of course you will, my lord!

183
00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.660
[Both giggle]

184
00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:39.660
I'm coming, Lord Momonosuke.

185
00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.990
I promise I'll save you!

186
00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:45.580
It seems the future of Wano
is in good hands!

187
00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.790
We're almost there, Luffy!

188
00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.420
Let me take these things off!

189
00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:52.800
I promised, right?

190
00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.050
Yes, please!

191
00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:58.180
But, uh, just in case.

192
00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.220
Could you throw them far away?

193
00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:03.520
I don't think they'll explode,
but I can't be sure.

194
00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:07.440
[Kaido growling]

195
00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:12.940
[gasps]

196
00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:14.820
What's wrong with this country?

197
00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:17.570
You're nothing but fools!

198
00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:24.620
[cries]

199
00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:28.040
[MOMONOSUKE]
Father. Mother.

200
00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.920
[MOMONOSUKE]
I am a disappointment.

201
00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.080
To you and to myself.

202
00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.710
All I wanted was to be able
to face you with pride

203
00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:37.470
when we reunite
in the afterlife!

204
00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.680
Hiyori, I wish I could
see you again,

205
00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:42.680
if even for a moment!

206
00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:46.680
I don't want to die!
Curse these tears!

207
00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:50.310
A samurai should not
cry in front of others.

208
00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:52.360
I am ashamed!

209
00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:58.110
[Momonosuke cries]

210
00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:00.450
[Luffy grunts]

211
00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:06.140
[Yamato gasps]
You took them off!

212
00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:11.050
Luffy?

213
00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.360
It was true!

214
00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:16.030
Go to hell you stupid, ugly,
cow-gorilla bastard!

215
00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:17.100
Huh?

216
00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.810
[cries]

217
00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:22.180
You really were
going to kill me!

218
00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:25.750
[QUEEN]
Where the hell did
that explosion come from?

219
00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:28.920
Somebody figure it out,
right now!

220
00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:39.220
Well, that settles it.
I've made up my mind.

221
00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:41.350
You're not my father anymore!

222
00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:42.430
[King, Queen gasp]

223
00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:44.940
[Queen growls]
Whatever
trouble you're starting,

224
00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:47.690
you better knock it off!

225
00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.760
Glad we weren't too late.

226
00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:11.680
But this isn't
our fight to start.

227
00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.970
[gasps]

228
00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:20.520
That honor belongs
to somebody else.

229
00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.730
And you know who it is!

230
00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.870
Nyago!

231
00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:41.920
[Denjiro grunts]

232
00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:47.090
[Denjiro yells]

233
00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:22.000
[grunts]

234
00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:33.140
Huh?

235
00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:35.100
[King gasps]
The Akazaya samurai!

236
00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:37.560
Where did they come from?!

237
00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:43.940
[JACK]
What? The Kings of the Minks?

238
00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.860
They're still alive?!

239
00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:51.490
[King sighs]
We won't lose
to a bunch of ghosts!

240
00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.740
[KING]
Izo!

241
00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.990
[grunts]

242
00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.230
Hey, you! Shitheads!

243
00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:02.330
Hey you, shitheads!

244
00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:05.320
Stop drinking and
come kick some ass!

245
00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:09.630
The party is off!
We're under attack!

246
00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:14.220
It's you. Kyoshiro!

247
00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.010
Kaido!

248
00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:20.060
[ALL gasp]

249
00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.560
[Kaido grunts]

250
00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:23.150
I'll kill you as many
times as it takes!

251
00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.110
[ODEN]
Surrender your name!

252
00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.490
Be as a child!

253
00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.580
[KAIDO]
The blades
you wield are powerless!

254
00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:38.830
They can't cut me!

255
00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.000
