Lead Performers down there.

508
00:31:45.640 --> 00:31:47.940
I must be patient.

509
00:31:47.940 --> 00:31:50.060
Please hold on, Lord Momonosuke!

510
00:31:50.060 --> 00:31:53.770
I promise I'll find
a way to save you!

511
00:31:55.180 --> 00:31:59.720
Everyone! Let us
reclaim the Land of Wano!

512
00:31:59.720 --> 00:32:03.350
[SAMURAI yell]

513
00:32:15.590 --> 00:32:19.220
Heh.

514
00:32:19.220 --> 00:32:25.470
[KAIDO laughs]

515
00:32:25.470 --> 00:32:28.060
[KAIDO]
I heard what
you said, Straw Hat!

516
00:32:28.060 --> 00:32:31.480
You're gonna kick my ass, huh?

517
00:32:31.480 --> 00:32:33.440
[KAIDO]
I accept your challenge!

518
00:32:33.440 --> 00:32:38.030
Let's see what you're made of!

519
00:32:38.030 --> 00:32:42.990
[KAIDO laughs]

520
00:32:38.450 --> 00:32:40.820
[KAIDO cackles]

521
00:32:39.350 --> 00:32:40.480
[SAMURAI scream]

522
00:32:42.990 --> 00:32:44.860
[KAIDO]
You're about to
face the strongest

523
00:32:44.860 --> 00:32:49.540
military power in the world!

524
00:33:07.050 --> 00:33:08.510
Sir Luffy!

525
00:33:08.510 --> 00:33:09.630
[LUFFY]
Hm?

526
00:33:15.930 --> 00:33:16.840
You have my thanks!

527
00:33:16.840 --> 00:33:17.640
You have my thanks.

528
00:33:17.640 --> 00:33:21.640
Same to you!
I'll catch up later!

529
00:33:23.400 --> 00:33:25.770
[KAIDO cackles]

530
00:33:46.090 --> 00:33:51.470
[KAIDO chuckles]
Damn that wind.

531
00:33:51.470 --> 00:33:52.770
Sobered me right up.

532
00:33:52.770 --> 00:33:56.980
[KAIDO]
A fight this epic
should be out in the open.

533
00:33:56.980 --> 00:34:00.350
Reminds me of
the last time we fought.

534
00:34:00.350 --> 00:34:02.520
[KAIDO]
How do you
expect to win this fight

535
00:34:00.740 --> 00:34:02.560
[KAIDO screams]

536
00:34:02.560 --> 00:34:05.010
now that Oden is dead?

537
00:34:05.010 --> 00:34:06.130
We don't have Oden,

538
00:34:06.130 --> 00:34:08.050
but there's something
else we do have.

539
00:34:08.050 --> 00:34:11.390
We were sure that you-gara
would turn into a dragon.

540
00:34:11.390 --> 00:34:14.770
Which means we would
have to fight outside.

541
00:34:18.940 --> 00:34:20.360
[KAIDO]
Huh?

542
00:34:22.360 --> 00:34:23.900
We have no fear!

543
00:34:23.900 --> 00:34:26.910
Red-hot anticipation
burns in our hearts!

544
00:34:26.910 --> 00:34:31.040
All our fury is about to
be unleashed on you-gara!

545
00:34:31.040 --> 00:34:33.580
[KAIDO]
Heh. The Mink tribe.

546
00:34:33.580 --> 00:34:35.080
[CAT VIPER]
Damn straight.

547
00:34:35.080 --> 00:34:38.630
They're the finest warriors
our kingdom has to offer.

548
00:34:43.380 --> 00:34:46.430
The snowfall is quite mild.

549
00:34:46.430 --> 00:34:46.560
The sky is clear,
and the full moon's out.

550
00:34:46.560 --> 00:34:49.740
The sky is clear and the
cherry blossoms flutter about
